# This project runs as three separate local processes, each with its own env file.
# Copy each one and fill in real values:
#
#   agent/.env.example    -> agent/.env.local   (LiveKit + OpenAI credentials for the Python worker)
#   backend/.env.example  -> backend/.env       (LiveKit credentials for the token/health API)
#   frontend/.env.example -> frontend/.env      (URL of the running backend, optional)
#
# See README.md for full setup instructions.
